@startuml dtb-business-process-inquiry
!include <archimate/Archimate>
title Business Process — Transfer inquiry (DTB)
caption VCB Architecture Modeling Language — Daily Transaction Banking trainee sample
left to right direction

' === Actor and Role ===
Business_Actor(custActor, "Business Actor BUS.ACT.01\nCustomer")
Business_Role(inqRole, "Business Role BUS.ROL.02\nInquiry requester")

' === Service ===
Business_Service(svcInq, "Business Service BUS.SVC.05\nTransfer inquiry")

' === Process ===
Business_Process(procInq, "Business Process BUS.PROC.07\nTransfer inquiry (list/detail)")

' === Business Object ===
Business_Object(objHist, "Business Object BUS.OBJ.03\nHistoryRecord")

' === Relationships ===
Rel_Assignment(custActor, inqRole, "assignment")
Rel_Assignment(inqRole, procInq, "assignment")
Rel_Access(procInq, objHist, "access: read")
Rel_Realization(procInq, svcInq, "realization")
Rel_Serving(svcInq, inqRole, "serving")

legend bottom
  Inquiry reads HistoryRecord only. NAPAS is not a participant.
  Teaching diagram — redraw in Archi for the dossier.
endlegend
@enduml
